OL,3,GNEWSAMapping data helps identify future
OL,4,Awildfire risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritain's mapping service is providing
OL,7,Fdata for government, emergency services
OL,8,Fand businesses that could help predict
OL,9,Fthe risk of future wildfires.
OL,11,FBy analysing information gathered by
OL,12,Fdrones, aircraft and satellites
OL,13,FOrdnance Survey (OS) says it is
OL,14,Foffering a clearer understanding of
OL,15,Fwhere and how climate impacts are
OL,16,Ftaking place and how to mitigate those
OL,17,Frisks.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
