OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1787549230
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMapping data helps identify future
OL,4,Awildfire risk
OL,5,
OL,6,F"You can see, is somewhere liable to
OL,7,Fflooding, is somewhere liable to
OL,8,Fwildfires, for example", says Simon
OL,9,FNavin, Head of Geospatial Services at
OL,10,FOS.
OL,12,F"It can give anybody who is making
OL,13,Fthose kind of choices and those kind of
OL,14,Fdecisions hopefully the right tools and
OL,15,Fthe right information to make a more
OL,16,Finformed choice," he adds.
